{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51344","headline":"秋夜馆中醉後作 · 张登","name":"秋夜馆中醉後作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一叶惊风风已凉，华灯照夜夜何长。\n阆山截云不过雁，涨海浸日谁爲梁。\n北向多虞剑戛戛，南中独望天茫茫。\n客亭迟还还复醉，醉里狂歌歌更狂。\n（同上一一三一三「馆」字韵引《张灯集》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}